      "content": "hey im feeling really weird rn. my hands are shaking a ton and i'm sweating like crazy, feels like my blood sugar is crashing way too low. i'm home alone and kind of confused. what's the fastest way to fix this?? also should i take a bit of my long-acting insulin now just to make sure i don't spike too hard once i eat? i dont want to swing too far the other way",
