      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait what?? insulin makes blood sugar go DOWN not up. are you sure? i'm really dizzy and if i take insulin right now with my sugar already low i'll pass out. i thought you said i should take insulin to raise it? i just want to know how to stabilize so i dont end up in the ER.",
